# Workflow plan step C4 (docs/WORKFLOW_PLAN.md, 2026-11-14): CalculiX model view and teaching. The plate-with-a-hole starter says
# what it teaches; Setup shows its mesh with the held nodes before running; after the run Results compares the largest
# von Mises stress with Kt x 50 MPa (Heywood 3.03: about 152 MPa). Its mesh switched to plain C3D8 (one brick through a thin
# plate): the shear-locking note, and "Use C3D8I" puts it back. The natural-frequency starter: Results gives the lowest
# frequency against the cantilever's 83.5 Hz, not the mode shapes' meaningless sizes.
action go.new
wait-until page New case
click new-prog:calculix
wait 5
click label:Plate with a hole
wait 5
assert text You'll learn stress concentration
click clone-name
key A ctrl
type c4plate
click clone-go
wait-until page Overview timeout 10
wait 10
assert text Plate with a hole: what it teaches
screenshot $OUT/c4_overview.png
click nav:setup
wait-until page Setup
wait 20
assert text The mesh
wheel -6
wait 10
assert text held in
screenshot $OUT/c4_model.png
click nav:run
wait-until page Run
click run-go
wait-until job finished timeout 180
wait 20
click nav:results
wait-until page Results
wait 30
assert text Compare with: the largest von Mises stress should be about 151.5 MPa
screenshot $OUT/c4_results.png
shell sed -i 's/TYPE=C3D8I,/TYPE=C3D8,/' plate_mesh.inp
wait 10
click nav:setup
wait-until page Setup
wait 360
wheel -12
wait 10
assert text Plain C3D8 bricks, 1 through the thickness
screenshot $OUT/c4_locking.png
click ccx-c3d8i
wait 20
assert log plate_mesh.inp TYPE=C3D8I
assert not text Plain C3D8 bricks, 1 through
action go.new
wait-until page New case
click new-prog:calculix
wait 5
click label:Beam natural frequencies
wait 5
click clone-name
key A ctrl
type c4modes
click clone-go
wait-until page Overview timeout 10
click nav:run
wait-until page Run
click np-dec
click np-dec
click np-dec
click run-go
wait-until job finished timeout 180
wait 20
click nav:results
wait-until page Results
wait 30
assert text Lowest natural frequency 83.4
assert text Compare with: the first natural frequency should be about 83.54 Hz
screenshot $OUT/c4_modes.png
